{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 0, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶，今天小乾休息吗？」", "text_idx": 204, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0586", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 1, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，说起来早上也没来活动室呢」", "text_idx": 206, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 2, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁在校门口也没看见纱纱」", "text_idx": 208, "plain": "「安洁在校门口也没看见纱纱」", "plain_idx": 208, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3427", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 3, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "昨天到最后，纱凪也没回到活动室。", "text_idx": 211, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 4, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "代替纱凪来的濑名告诉我们纱凪的身体出了点问题。", "text_idx": 212, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 5, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "结果“美羽”也是由濑名同学送到纱凪家里的。", "text_idx": 213, "plain": "结果“美羽”也是由濑名同学送到纱凪家里的。", "plain_idx": 213, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 6, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「乾同学没事吧……打个电话给她吧」", "text_idx": 214, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 7, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不用担心了。只是感冒而已。这个时候肯定还在睡觉吧，打电话过去也只是添麻烦而已」", "text_idx": 216, "plain": "「不用担心了。只是感冒而已。这个时候肯定还在睡觉吧，打电话过去也只是添麻烦而已」", "plain_idx": 216, "len": 40, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4400", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 8, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「最近冷下来了呢——」", "text_idx": 219, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0587", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 9, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我家也到处都很冷啊」", "text_idx": 221, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 10, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「小乾家里是什么样的呢。果然是那种有地暖的大豪宅吧？」", "text_idx": 222, "plain": "「小乾家里是什么样的呢。果然是那种有地暖的大豪宅吧？」", "plain_idx": 222, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0588", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 11, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「谁知道呢。纱凪也是……大小姐吧」", "text_idx": 224, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 12, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁觉得，女孩子这种神秘的地方是很重要的」", "text_idx": 225, "plain": "「安洁觉得，女孩子这种神秘的地方是很重要的」", "plain_idx": 225, "len": 22, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3428", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 13, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「全身上下都是秘密的女仆都这么说了，那就肯定没错」", "text_idx": 227, "plain": "「全身上下都是秘密的女仆都这么说了，那就肯定没错」", "plain_idx": 227, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0589", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 14, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵呵，女仆只会对未来的少爷坦露一切」", "text_idx": 229, "plain": "「呵呵呵，女仆只会对未来的少爷坦露一切」", "plain_idx": 229, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3429", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 15, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「安洁的少爷……还没找到吗？」", "text_idx": 231, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0590", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 16, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「隼太同学，你是要安洁去死对吧」", "text_idx": 233, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3430", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 17, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我倒没打算把你逼到绝境啊」", "text_idx": 235, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0591", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 18, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不管怎么说，那个纱凪竟然请假了，我还是很担心啊。", "text_idx": 237, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 19, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那大家轮流记一下上课的笔记给她吧。马上也要期末考试了……」", "text_idx": 238, "plain": "「那大家轮流记一下上课的笔记给她吧。马上也要期末考试了……」", "plain_idx": 238, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 20, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好。我来做第一节的。下午我犯困」", "text_idx": 239, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0592", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 21, "speaker": "安洁", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「女生的保健体育课就交给安洁吧」", "text_idx": 241, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ag3431", "char_id": "アンジェ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 22, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「剩下的课就由我和濑名同学分担，可以吧？」", "text_idx": 243, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 23, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……我一个人会记的，就不用麻烦你了」", "text_idx": 244, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4401", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 24, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这怎么行，只有我一个人帮不上忙我也过意不去啊」", "text_idx": 246, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 25, "speaker": "爱理", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你来帮忙的话，肯定会惹纱凪不高兴的吧」", "text_idx": 247, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ar4402", "char_id": "愛理"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 26, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜……」", "text_idx": 249, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 27, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还没得到小乾的信赖吗」", "text_idx": 250, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0593", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 28, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「隼太你呢？」", "text_idx": 252, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 29, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哈哈，连对视都不行呢」", "text_idx": 253, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0594", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 30, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "哈哈，笑不出来啊。", "text_idx": 255, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 31, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「纱纱果然请假了啊……打电话给她也不接，好担心啊」", "text_idx": 257, "plain": "「纱纱果然请假了啊……打电话给她也不接，好担心啊」", "plain_idx": 257, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1369", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 32, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「濑名同学说她感冒了。昨天没来活动室也是这个原因」", "text_idx": 259, "plain": "「濑名同学说她感冒了。昨天没来活动室也是这个原因」", "plain_idx": 259, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 33, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没问题吧……纱纱动不动就勉强自己」", "text_idx": 260, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1370", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 34, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这方面学姐不也一样吗」", "text_idx": 262, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 35, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我已经反省过了，不会再勉强自己了哦？」", "text_idx": 263, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1371", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 36, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「之前也是，给新吾和小樱添麻烦了呢……」", "text_idx": 265, "plain": "「之前也是，给新吾和小樱添麻烦了呢……」", "plain_idx": 265, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1372", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 37, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "虽然学姐想和我牵手，但注意到了什么又把手缩回去了。", "text_idx": 267, "plain": "虽然学姐想和我牵手，但注意到了什么又把手缩回去了。", "plain_idx": 267, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 38, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……总觉得都快成习惯了呢」", "text_idx": 268, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1373", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 39, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶？」", "text_idx": 270, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 40, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「和喜欢的人牵手」", "text_idx": 271, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1374", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 41, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐小声地说着，俏皮地吐了吐舌。", "text_idx": 273, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 42, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在大街上总有那种不分场合黏在一起的情侣，现在我也多多少少理解了他们的心情。", "text_idx": 274, "plain": "在大街上总有那种不分场合黏在一起的情侣，现在我也多多少少理解了他们的心情。", "plain_idx": 274, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 43, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "像这样说着话，就连我也不禁想要碰一下美羽学姐了。", "text_idx": 275, "plain": "像这样说着话，就连我也不禁想要碰一下美羽学姐了。", "plain_idx": 275, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 44, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "甚至连周围人的目光都不在乎了。", "text_idx": 276, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 45, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「抱歉啊，这样来见你……」", "text_idx": 277, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1375", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 46, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊……下次我去三年级的教室找你吧？」", "text_idx": 279, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 47, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这可不行～」", "text_idx": 280, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1376", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 48, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「为什么呢？」", "text_idx": 282, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 49, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「三年级可没有试验班，那边全是女孩子」", "text_idx": 283, "plain": "「三年级可没有试验班，那边全是女孩子」", "plain_idx": 283, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1377", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 50, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你要是去了那种地方，你觉得会怎么样？」", "text_idx": 285, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1378", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 51, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……谁知道呢？」", "text_idx": 287, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 9, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 52, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大家因为升学的事情而烦恼着，积累了不少压力。要是来了一个年轻的男生……」", "text_idx": 288, "plain": "「大家因为升学的事情而烦恼着，积累了不少压力。要是来了一个年轻的男生……」", "plain_idx": 288, "len": 37, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1379", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 53, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呜，接下来发生的事我就说不出口了……」", "text_idx": 290, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1380", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 54, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我不禁想做恶作剧，让学姐说说看。", "text_idx": 292, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 55, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "和学姐说这种话，总觉得很新鲜啊……", "text_idx": 293, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 56, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「哦。新吾在这啊。下节课是体育课，该去换衣服了啊～？」", "text_idx": 294, "plain": "「哦。新吾在这啊。下节课是体育课，该去换衣服了啊～？」", "plain_idx": 294, "len": 27, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0595", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 57, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，好的」", "text_idx": 296, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 58, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「天羽学姐好～」", "text_idx": 297, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0596", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 59, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「…………」", "text_idx": 299, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1381", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 60, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶，是我脸上沾了什么吗？」", "text_idx": 301, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0597", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 61, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，没有，没什么。新吾，回见了」", "text_idx": 303, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1382", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 62, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「好的。回见」", "text_idx": 305, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 63, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「对椋梨连“回见”……都不说吗」", "text_idx": 306, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0598", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 64, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我一边听着隼太这样念叨，一边向回过头的学姐招手。", "text_idx": 308, "plain": "我一边听着隼太这样念叨，一边向回过头的学姐招手。", "plain_idx": 308, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 65, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……？」", "text_idx": 309, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0599", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 66, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「接下来，我们也该去换衣服……」", "text_idx": 311, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 67, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不了。换衣服之前我先听你细说一下吧」", "text_idx": 312, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0600", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 68, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「听我细说？」", "text_idx": 314, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 69, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「……唔？！」", "text_idx": 315, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 70, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "突然隼太把手搭在我的肩膀上，给我胸部来了一拳。", "text_idx": 316, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 71, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你和天羽学姐发生什么了？」", "text_idx": 317, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0601", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 72, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没、没什么啊」", "text_idx": 319, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 73, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「少废话，直说了吧。什么都没发生的男女才不会笑着相互挥手道别吧？」", "text_idx": 320, "plain": "「少废话，直说了吧。什么都没发生的男女才不会笑着相互挥手道别吧？」", "plain_idx": 320, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0602", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 74, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我和美羽学姐的关系已经遭到怀疑了。", "text_idx": 322, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 75, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "算了，也没必要对隼太隐瞒吧。", "text_idx": 323, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 76, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "在班上也希望能有一个能理解我的人啊。", "text_idx": 324, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 77, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那希望你能和我约好别告诉别人啊？」", "text_idx": 325, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 78, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「什么啊，是和天羽学姐交往了吗」", "text_idx": 326, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0603", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 79, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我还什么都没说呢」", "text_idx": 328, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 80, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「看到那样的情形，一般都懂了吧」", "text_idx": 329, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0604", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 81, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我和学姐之间情侣的氛围已经这么浓了吗？", "text_idx": 331, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 82, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "不注意点的话在大家面前就瞒不住了啊。", "text_idx": 332, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 83, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过，竟然是那个天羽学姐吗……」", "text_idx": 333, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0605", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 84, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我和学姐……果然不相配吗……」", "text_idx": 335, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 85, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「没这啦，只是觉得新吾正适合那种大姐姐的类型」", "text_idx": 336, "plain": "「没这啦，只是觉得新吾正适合那种大姐姐的类型」", "plain_idx": 336, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0606", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 86, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是吗」", "text_idx": 338, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 4, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 87, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「你平常不怎么依靠他人吧？所以有个能让你撒娇的女朋友正好」", "text_idx": 339, "plain": "「你平常不怎么依靠他人吧？所以有个能让你撒娇的女朋友正好」", "plain_idx": 339, "len": 29, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0607", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 88, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「天羽学姐一看就是会宠着你的类型～」", "text_idx": 341, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0608", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 89, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那，确实……」", "text_idx": 343, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 90, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我个人确实想要向学姐撒娇，但是考虑到学姐的性格……", "text_idx": 344, "plain": "我个人确实想要向学姐撒娇，但是考虑到学姐的性格……", "plain_idx": 344, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 91, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "『不过……我也许会对新吾做各种各样的事情，直到把你弄坏……』", "text_idx": 345, "plain": "『不过……我也许会对新吾做各种各样的事情，直到把你弄坏……』", "plain_idx": 345, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1383", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 92, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "对这种情况我该不该感到高兴呢。", "text_idx": 347, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 93, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「总之这件事对大家……」", "text_idx": 348, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 94, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我知道的啦。我会在一旁微笑着守望你们的」", "text_idx": 349, "plain": "「我知道的啦。我会在一旁微笑着守望你们的」", "plain_idx": 349, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0609", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 95, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「真是恶趣味啊」", "text_idx": 351, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 8, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 96, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过，你自己也注意点啊」", "text_idx": 352, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 13, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0610", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 97, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「注意是说？」", "text_idx": 354, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 98, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「笨蛋，你冷静下来稍微想想看」", "text_idx": 355, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0611", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 99, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「像学姐这样的博爱主义者，至今为止都是向动物们倾注爱情对吧」", "text_idx": 357, "plain": "「像学姐这样的博爱主义者，至今为止都是向动物们倾注爱情对吧」", "plain_idx": 357, "len": 30, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0612", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 100, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这些对动物们倾注的爱情，现在都倾注在你身上了哦？」", "text_idx": 359, "plain": "「这些对动物们倾注的爱情，现在都倾注在你身上了哦？」", "plain_idx": 359, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0613", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 101, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「我很担心新吾啊。不知道新吾能不能承受住那个人全力倾注的爱之电流啊」", "text_idx": 361, "plain": "「我很担心新吾啊。不知道新吾能不能承受住那个人全力倾注的爱之电流啊」", "plain_idx": 361, "len": 34, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0614", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 102, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是因为爱的电流太强而麻痹吗」", "text_idx": 363, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 103, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在麻痹之前让对方麻痹」", "text_idx": 364, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0615", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 104, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "隼太一边这么说一边拍了拍我的背。", "text_idx": 366, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 105, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过，就算有了女朋友也别忘了兄弟啊～」", "text_idx": 367, "plain": "「不过，就算有了女朋友也别忘了兄弟啊～」", "plain_idx": 367, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0616", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 106, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「这是当然。我才是请你多多关照了啊」", "text_idx": 369, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 107, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过，前提是天羽学姐同意啊」", "text_idx": 370, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 15, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0617", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 108, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽学姐肯定会同意的」", "text_idx": 372, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 109, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是吗～？别看学姐那样，其实在恋爱方面上是相当容易吃醋的类型呢～」", "text_idx": 373, "plain": "「是吗～？别看学姐那样，其实在恋爱方面上是相当容易吃醋的类型呢～」", "plain_idx": 373, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0618", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 110, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "就目前来说，我感受不到学姐那种样子。", "text_idx": 375, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 111, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "倒不如说一直不嫉妒别人反而有些不安啊。", "text_idx": 376, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 112, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不管怎么说」", "text_idx": 377, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0619", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 113, "speaker": "隼太", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「恭喜了」", "text_idx": 379, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "ht0620", "char_id": "隼太"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 114, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「唔唔？！」", "text_idx": 381, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 115, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "狠狠打在我腹部的拳头，让我痛苦与快乐参半。", "text_idx": 382, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 116, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是吗。椋梨注意到我们的事情了啊」", "text_idx": 383, "plain": "「是吗。椋梨注意到我们的事情了啊」", "plain_idx": 383, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1384", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 117, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「是的。还收到了附带下勾拳的祝福」", "text_idx": 385, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 118, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「呵呵呵。真好呢，有能这样聊天的挚友」", "text_idx": 386, "plain": "「呵呵呵。真好呢，有能这样聊天的挚友」", "plain_idx": 386, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1385", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 119, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜溜——」", "text_idx": 389, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0374", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 120, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "放学后，在活动室里和学姐独处的时候，美羽学姐就会成为我专属的恋人。", "text_idx": 392, "plain": "放学后，在活动室里和学姐独处的时候，美羽学姐就会成为我专属的恋人。", "plain_idx": 392, "len": 33, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 121, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "手被突然牵起的时候，我高兴得几乎不能自已。", "text_idx": 393, "plain": "手被突然牵起的时候，我高兴得几乎不能自已。", "plain_idx": 393, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 122, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "学姐的手真的很娇小，光是在她旁边就会不自觉地想抱住学姐。", "text_idx": 394, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 123, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「在同性里被别人仰慕也很棒啊～」", "text_idx": 395, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1386", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 124, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「美羽学姐不也一样吗」", "text_idx": 397, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 125, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「才没有那回事呢。我都没有能倾诉新吾的事情的朋友呢」", "text_idx": 398, "plain": "「才没有那回事呢。我都没有能倾诉新吾的事情的朋友呢」", "plain_idx": 398, "len": 26, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1387", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 126, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不过，学姐给我一种会在情人节收到很多女生送来巧克力的印象……」", "text_idx": 400, "plain": "「不过，学姐给我一种会在情人节收到很多女生送来巧克力的印象……」", "plain_idx": 400, "len": 32, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 127, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「因为一直在女校啊。大家也都经常会交换巧克力的」", "text_idx": 401, "plain": "「因为一直在女校啊。大家也都经常会交换巧克力的」", "plain_idx": 401, "len": 24, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1388", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 128, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「顺带一问，学姐收到了多少巧克力呢？」", "text_idx": 403, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 129, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「大概……五十个左右吧」", "text_idx": 404, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 12, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1389", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 130, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "实力过于悬殊。", "text_idx": 406, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 7, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 131, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "让这种人做我的女朋友，真的好吗？", "text_idx": 407, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 132, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "很担心自己会不会被女生嫉恨。", "text_idx": 408, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 133, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「啊，对了。二年级马上就要进行期末考试了吧？」", "text_idx": 409, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1390", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 134, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「确实是这样呢。下周开始就要期末了呢……」", "text_idx": 411, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 135, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「有在好好学习吗？」", "text_idx": 412, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1391", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 136, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「完全没学什么。倒不如说，一点都学不下去」", "text_idx": 414, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 21, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 137, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "现在满脑子都是学姐的事情，连一个英语单词都记不住。", "text_idx": 415, "plain": "现在满脑子都是学姐的事情，连一个英语单词都记不住。", "plain_idx": 415, "len": 25, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 138, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "要想想办法啊，不然可能真的要悲剧了。", "text_idx": 416, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 18, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 139, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「那明天和后天来我家一起学习吗？」", "text_idx": 417, "plain": "「那明天和后天来我家一起学习吗？」", "plain_idx": 417, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1392", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 140, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「诶……真的可以吗？」", "text_idx": 419, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 141, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯。美羽老师会严厉教导你的～」", "text_idx": 420, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1393", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 142, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "……这么可爱的老师是犯规的。", "text_idx": 422, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 14, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 143, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "光是“美羽老师”这一句话就让我清楚地意识到自己学不进去。", "text_idx": 423, "plain": "光是“美羽老师”这一句话就让我清楚地意识到自己学不进去。", "plain_idx": 423, "len": 28, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 144, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「怎么样呢？还是说明天后天已经有约了？」", "text_idx": 424, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 20, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1394", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 145, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「不，没这回事。那就拜托了，美羽老师」", "text_idx": 426, "plain": "「不，没这回事。那就拜托了，美羽老师」", "plain_idx": 426, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 146, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "我已经放弃了期末考试。", "text_idx": 427, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 11, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 147, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "周末就和美羽老师高高兴兴地学习吧。就这样做吧。", "text_idx": 428, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 23, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 148, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「被叫成美羽老师，还是有点不好意思呢」", "text_idx": 429, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 19, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1395", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 149, "speaker": "新吾", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「要称呼的话，天羽老师会更好吧？」", "text_idx": 431, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 17, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 150, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「嗯～……」", "text_idx": 432, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 6, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1396", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 151, "speaker": "熊喵", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「溜～？」", "text_idx": 434, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 5, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "pn0375", "char_id": "ぱんにゃ"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 152, "speaker": "美羽", "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "「还是想让新吾叫我美羽老师呢♪」", "text_idx": 436, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 16, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": "mu1397", "char_id": "みう"}]}
{"script": "scenario_miu_route02_05.txt", "scene": "*start", "row": 153, "speaker": null, "flag": 64, "pages": [{"page": 0, "text": "再见了，期末考试……", "text_idx": 438, "plain": null, "plain_idx": null, "len": 10, "alt_speaker": null, "alt_speaker_idx": null, "voice": null, "char_id": null}]}
